---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" description="About the artist and studio.">
  <div class="wrap content-page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Replace this paragraph with a short artist biography: where the work
      is made, what materials and themes recur, and how someone can visit
      the studio or see the work in person.
    </p>
    <p>
      A second paragraph works well for exhibition history, training, or
      press mentions, but isn't required — keep this page as short or as
      long as feels right.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
